text = "Deep beneath a forgotten continent lies Lumenfell, an ancient 
subterranean world built around a mystical energy called Gleam, 
a bioluminescent essence that once nourished all life below. The 
denizens of Lumenfell thrived in towering cavern cities, glowing 
forests, and crystal-lined tunnels… until the Gleam fractured.

Long ago, a cosmic event known as the Sundering Pulse splintered the 
Gleam into unstable shards, warping creatures, collapsing kingdoms, 
and leaving behind areas of shimmering, volatile light. Many of the 
original inhabitants either vanished or twisted into echoing husks 
called Hollowed Refractions, beings who exist as distorted copies 
of their former selves, locked in repeating loops of emotion and memory."
